<title>HONG KONG: Kookmin Bank launches $200 mln sub FRN.</title>
<headline>Kookmin Bank launches $200 mln sub FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated 144a floating rate notes issue was announced by the lead managers and bookrunners.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOOKMIN BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$200 MLN  COUPON     STEP-UP*  MATURITY  DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE     SUB 144A FRN  ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER  99.872</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	YR 5	LAUNCH    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON	REPAYMENT  BULLET</p>
<p> RATING  **Baa1/BBB+    DENOMS     US$500K   PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p>SALES LMTS UK/US/HK/KOREA/144A ELIGIBLE/REG S CATEGORY 2</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	    CRS DEF    NO	  FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH     HOME CTRY  S.KOREA   PAY DATE  30.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES	 32.5BP AS   MGT/UND    12.5BP    SELL CONC 20BP</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS AND BOOKRUNNERS   CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA AND</p>
<p>					   MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST</p>
<p> NOTES    *3ML+60BP PAYABLE QUARTERLY FOR YEARS 1-5</p>
<p>	    *3ML+185BP PAYABLE QUARTERLY FOR YEARS 6-10</p>
<p>	   **RE-OFFER YIELD 3ML+63BP PAYABLE QUARTERLY FOR YRS 1-5</p>
<p>	     AND 3ML+122.5BP PAYABLE QUARTERLY FOR YRS 1-10.</p>
<p>	  ***EXPECTED RATINGS</p>
<p>	 ****A GROUP IS BEING FORMED.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
